            <div xml:id="d708">

                <pb facs="0937" n="825" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg825"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.51/1079</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Jefferson</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-08T11:00:00-05:45">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 8, 1918, 11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>President Chamorro, in conformity with Article 7 of financial plan, has
                    designated Don Octaviano César as the Nicaraguan member of the High Commission.
                    I consider the appointment excellent.</p>
                <p>Chamorro requests that the Secretary of State make his appointments at this time.
                    I am of the opinion that the appointment of Lindberg will be satisfactory, as
                    well as that of Professor Jenks as umpire.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jefferson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d708-a1.xml" xpointer="d708-a1"/>
